  "notes": [
    "Only these downloadable monolingual packages are supported.",
    "English explanations (description_en) are translated on demand by the app into the native language.",
    "Word cards require the same english_id in both languages; meanings are approximate.",
    "Regional packs are content packs of an existing language, not new language codes.",
    "Packages with has_ui=true also provide interface translations (machine translated).",
    "New VCU100 construction English package has 178 dedicated semantic IDs and a separate 178-entry PT-BR companion; both packages must be installed for EN/PT bilingual study in current app builds. APK installation/dependency and UI regression tests remain pending.",
    "VCU100 Business English US: 156 aligned English and PT-BR entries with unique per-package semantic IDs. Android companion auto-install remains pending code support.",
    "Healthcare English International VCU100: 170 professional vocabulary entries paired with PT-BR; clinical definitions are for language study, not medical advice. Manual Android test remains pending.",
    "Architecture & Interior Design English VCU100 has 180 unique aligned en-US and pt-BR entries; mobile installation and per-package isolation tests remain pending.",
    "Factory Japanese 179 original terms with kana, romaji and PT-BR companion. Android dependency/UI/progress testing pending.",
